---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the RestoreTemplate.
---@field backupSelectionConfig? gcp.unstable.backupdr_v1beta.BackupSelectionConfig Required. Backup selection configuration.
---@field postRestoreConfig? gcp.unstable.backupdr_v1beta.PostRestoreConfig Optional. Post-restore configuration.
---@field executionSummary? gcp.unstable.backupdr_v1beta.ExecutionSummary Output only. Summary of the last execution.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.backupdr_v1beta.RestoreTemplateStateEnum|string Output only. The state of the restore template.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time when the restore template was created.
---@field verificationConfig? gcp.unstable.backupdr_v1beta.VerificationConfig Optional. Verification configuration.
---@field parent string Required. The restore template project and location in the format 'projects/{project_id}/locations/{location}'.
---@field requestId? string Optional. An optional request ID to identify requests. Specify a unique request ID so that if you must retry your request, the server will know to ignore the request if it has already been completed. The request ID must be a valid UUID with the exception that zero UUID is not supported (00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000).
